.TH AGENTBAR-HOOK 1 "" "agentbar" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agentbar-hook \- record one Claude Code hook event for AgentBar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agentbar-hook \-\-event
.I type
< payload.json
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run by Claude Code, not by hand. Reads one hook payload as JSON on standard
input and records it in AgentBar's local state, which the GNOME Shell extension
displays. It writes nothing to standard output and exits 1, never 2, on
failure, so it can never block or approve anything in Claude Code.
.PP
.I type
is one of session_start, pre_tool_use, post_tool_use, notification,
permission_request, stop, session_end, error.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/state/agentbar/state.json
and
.IR ~/.local/state/agentbar/events.jsonl .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR agentbar (1)
